I had no freedom at all.

289
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:03,839
He even threatened me with my child's life.

290
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:07,680
Is Naonao your child with Lu Haifeng?

291
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:08,359
No.

292
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:12,880
I was already pregnant when I met Lu Haifeng.

293
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:27,480
The police shooting at Old Street Mahjong Parlor,

294
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:28,039
you still remember it, right?

295
00:23:29,079 --> 00:23:29,480
I remember.

296
00:23:29,799 --> 00:23:30,680
Where were you when the shots were fired?

297
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:32,519
I was out paying the electricity bill then.

298
00:23:32,759 --> 00:23:33,880
When I asked you back then,

299
00:23:34,039 --> 00:23:35,680
you said you booked a check-up for your child.

300
00:23:36,519 --> 00:23:36,759
What time?

301
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:38,960
Eleven thirty.

302
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:40,839
It's been so long, and you still remember?

303
00:23:42,079 --> 00:23:43,240
Anything about my child,

304
00:23:44,119 --> 00:23:45,440
I always remember very clearly.

305
00:23:59,200 --> 00:24:00,640
Take a look. Do you know these two?

306
00:24:06,799 --> 00:24:07,279
I do.

307
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:11,160
When did they first approach you?

308
00:24:12,359 --> 00:24:12,720
Where?

309
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:15,440
At a convenience store.

310
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:16,960
Why did they come to you?

311
00:24:19,079 --> 00:24:20,200
I didn't know at first.

312
00:24:22,279 --> 00:24:22,839
And later?

313
00:24:25,039 --> 00:24:27,519
This guy... This guy told me...

314
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:30,480
his boss told him

315
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:33,200
that as long as they caught me,

316
00:24:34,400 --> 00:24:36,359
they could negotiate with Lu Haifeng.

317
00:24:37,079 --> 00:24:37,519
Negotiate?

318
00:24:39,119 --> 00:24:39,599
About what?

319
00:24:41,839 --> 00:24:42,359
Answer me.

320
00:24:45,200 --> 00:24:45,640
"Spring Snow."

321
00:24:46,200 --> 00:24:46,720
About "Spring Snow."

322
00:24:46,720 --> 00:24:48,599
So you knew Lu Haifeng was dealing drugs, right?

323
00:24:50,359 --> 00:24:51,680
So you're accomplices, aren't you?

324
00:24:51,680 --> 00:24:52,079
We're not accomplices.

325
00:24:52,240 --> 00:24:52,880
Aren't you?

326
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:54,400
Not accomplices. I'm not an accomplice.

327
00:24:54,400 --> 00:24:55,680
Look. Look.

328
00:24:56,240 --> 00:24:57,039
I'm a victim.

329
00:24:57,799 --> 00:24:59,440
He controlled me. He injected me with drugs.

330
00:25:01,359 --> 00:25:02,160
I'm a victim.

331
00:25:05,519 --> 00:25:06,400
Let me ask you another question.

332
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:08,799
After the hostage incident,

333
00:25:08,799 --> 00:25:10,119
why did you move next to the Special Police Unit?

334
00:25:13,039 --> 00:25:13,519
It's safe.

335
00:25:16,119 --> 00:25:17,400
It's safe right outside the Special Police Unit.

336
00:25:35,039 --> 00:25:36,200
You've been up all night.

337
00:25:37,480 --> 00:25:38,480
Did you get anything out of her?

338
00:25:45,319 --> 00:25:46,319
She said yes.

339
00:25:47,839 --> 00:25:51,000
She said she knew Lu Haifeng was making and selling drugs.

340
00:25:51,279 --> 00:25:52,920
But she was never involved herself.

341
00:25:54,839 --> 00:25:57,200
For the details, we'll have to wait for further investigation.

342
00:26:10,759 --> 00:26:11,359
Chief Liao,

343
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:13,519
with such a big case

344
00:26:14,119 --> 00:26:15,200
involving so many people,

345
00:26:15,920 --> 00:26:18,319
we need to investigate everyone thoroughly.

346
00:26:18,880 --> 00:26:19,519
Don't worry.

347
00:26:22,799 --> 00:26:23,400
I'm not.

348
00:26:29,519 --> 00:26:30,079
Say...

349
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:32,839
you've spent a lot of time with her.

350
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:37,279
Does she have any bad habits?

351
00:26:38,960 --> 00:26:40,599
No. Not that I've noticed.

352
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:47,400
What's wrong?

353
00:26:47,720 --> 00:26:48,079
Nothing.

354
00:26:55,640 --> 00:26:56,240
What is it?

355
00:27:00,200 --> 00:27:00,839
She uses drugs.

356
00:27:09,920 --> 00:27:12,599
She said Lu Haifeng injected her by force.

357
00:27:16,960 --> 00:27:18,039
But no matter what,

358
00:27:18,039 --> 00:27:19,359
getting hooked on that stuff is easy,

359
00:27:20,240 --> 00:27:21,319
but quitting isn't.

360
00:27:29,799 --> 00:27:30,079
All right.

361
00:27:31,519 --> 00:27:33,160
Go get some rest. You've been up all night.

362
00:27:33,680 --> 00:27:34,160
All right then.

363
00:27:34,799 --> 00:27:36,400
Let me know when you get an update.

364
00:27:37,359 --> 00:27:37,680
Don't worry.

365
00:27:40,079 --> 00:27:41,160
Just put it here. Don't worry about it.

366
00:27:52,599 --> 00:27:54,000
Then how did you forget the birthday?

367
00:28:03,160 --> 00:28:03,559
Chief Zhao.

368
00:28:03,680 --> 00:28:04,079
Commissar Tan.

369
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:05,480
Chief Guo.

370
00:28:08,480 --> 00:28:09,240
How's your recovery going?

371
00:28:10,599 --> 00:28:11,200
I'm fine.

372
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:12,680
Have a seat, please.

373
00:28:13,839 --> 00:28:15,000
Are you... Are you

374
00:28:17,319 --> 00:28:18,160
going with the Chief?

375
00:28:18,680 --> 00:28:19,000
Yes.

376
00:28:19,519 --> 00:28:19,839
Are you done taking photos?

377
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:20,359
Yes, all done.

378
00:28:20,880 --> 00:28:21,680
Please, take a seat.

379
00:28:25,079 --> 00:28:27,079
You look like you're recovering well.

380
00:28:27,319 --> 00:28:29,119
Yes, yes, I'm fully recovered.

381
00:28:29,359 --> 00:28:30,920
Just give the word, and I'll be back at work.

382
00:28:30,920 --> 00:28:32,359
No, you just stay here and rest.

383
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:34,720
Otherwise, people will say

384
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:36,559
I'm mistreating our hero.

385
00:28:37,960 --> 00:28:38,319
Chief Guo,

386
00:28:39,440 --> 00:28:41,799
I was wrong about this. I lost my head.

387
00:28:42,119 --> 00:28:42,400
No.

388
00:28:42,400 --> 00:28:43,799
You can't, you can't say that.

389
00:28:44,319 --> 00:28:45,839
With such a huge accomplishment dropping from the sky,

390
00:28:45,839 --> 00:28:47,400
even I'd lose my head if it happened to me.

391
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:48,119
Right, Chief?

392
00:28:48,680 --> 00:28:49,519
I really wasn't thinking clearly.

393
00:28:49,640 --> 00:28:51,039
When I saw the suspect,

394
00:28:51,039 --> 00:28:52,640
I... I couldn't hold back. I couldn't control myself.

395
00:28:52,839 --> 00:28:53,920
I... I just followed him.

396
00:28:54,119 --> 00:28:54,480
Tan Yan,

397
00:28:55,160 --> 00:28:58,000
that's called being fearless in the face of danger and decisive.

398
00:28:58,400 --> 00:28:58,720
Right?

399
00:28:59,720 --> 00:29:00,880
Our Chief summed it up perfectly.

400
00:29:01,279 --> 00:29:01,799
Spot on.

401
00:29:03,160 --> 00:29:04,079
Because right now,

402
00:29:04,119 --> 00:29:05,400
word has spread throughout the whole bureau.

403
00:29:05,480 --> 00:29:08,240
They say our... our city's Special Police Unit

404
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:10,640
has a new commissar who excels with pen and sword.

405
00:29:11,839 --> 00:29:13,799
You can write reports and catch drug lords.

406
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:15,559
Right now, you are

407
00:29:15,559 --> 00:29:17,160
the role model of our Red Leaf public security system.

408
00:29:17,440 --> 00:29:18,200
Right, Chief?

409
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:18,480
Right, Chief?

410
00:29:18,480 --> 00:29:19,400
I don't deserve that. I really don't.

411
00:29:20,160 --> 00:29:21,960
It's the result of everyone's hard work.

412
00:29:22,920 --> 00:29:24,160
I just got lucky.

413
00:29:25,480 --> 00:29:26,839
You risked your life for this.

414
00:29:26,839 --> 00:29:28,039
How can you call that getting lucky?

415
00:29:28,640 --> 00:29:29,880
Tan Yan, rest assured.

416
00:29:29,880 --> 00:29:31,440
Everyone sees what you've done.

417
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:33,240
For all these honors of yours,

418
00:29:33,240 --> 00:29:34,640
the bureau will do

419
00:29:35,039 --> 00:29:36,519
everything we can to fight for them for you.

420
00:29:39,240 --> 00:29:43,240
Having your approval is more important than any merit.

421
00:29:43,720 --> 00:29:44,319
Rest up well.

422
00:29:44,839 --> 00:29:45,359
Take your time.

423
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:46,599
Thank you, Chief Guo.

424
00:29:46,599 --> 00:29:46,920
Alright.

425
00:29:47,599 --> 00:29:47,839
Good.

426
00:29:47,839 --> 00:29:48,119
Don't worry, Chief.

427
00:29:53,279 --> 00:29:54,000
Thanks, Chief Zhao.

428
00:29:54,240 --> 00:29:54,920
Don't mention it.

429
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:55,839
How are you getting back?

430
00:29:56,000 --> 00:29:56,799
My... My car is over there.

431
00:29:57,799 --> 00:29:58,839
Congratulations, Commissar Tan.

432
00:30:00,039 --> 00:30:01,480
What for?

433
00:30:03,559 --> 00:30:04,480
Once the case is closed,

434
00:30:04,759 --> 00:30:06,000
they're preparing to recommend you for a First-Class Merit.

435
00:30:06,920 --> 00:30:07,759
A First-Class Merit?

436
00:30:09,759 --> 00:30:10,720
I was quite surprised too.

437
00:30:12,839 --> 00:30:14,160
To get a First-Class Merit while alive...

438
00:30:14,160 --> 00:30:16,799
That requires such a massive mission

439
00:30:16,799 --> 00:30:18,119
and outstanding performance.

440
00:30:22,920 --> 00:30:23,319
Look,

441
00:30:24,319 --> 00:30:25,960
Lu Haifeng is the leader of the syndicate.

442
00:30:26,319 --> 00:30:27,920
The "Spring Snow" case had a huge impact.

443
00:30:28,559 --> 00:30:30,960
You risked your life to take him down.

444
00:30:32,480 --> 00:30:33,200
You deserve a First-Class Merit.

445
00:30:34,200 --> 00:30:35,079
I think you're worthy of it.

446
00:30:38,279 --> 00:30:38,960
You think?

447
00:30:42,359 --> 00:30:44,160
You're my wife, of course you think so.

448
00:30:49,480 --> 00:30:50,799
I didn't expect that. Tell me.

449
00:30:52,720 --> 00:30:53,440
I want to eat steamed buns.

450
00:30:55,599 --> 00:30:56,559
I want to eat steamed buns.

451
00:31:00,880 --> 00:31:01,480
I'll make them for you.

452
00:31:02,920 --> 00:31:03,759
Never knew you could do that.

453
00:31:05,160 --> 00:31:05,920
I'll give it a try.

454
00:31:07,839 --> 00:31:09,680
You have to eat whatever I make.

455
00:31:13,759 --> 00:31:14,119
I will.

456
00:31:16,039 --> 00:31:16,640
Make vegetarian ones, then.

457
00:31:18,039 --> 00:31:18,680
You want vegetarian?

458
00:31:19,640 --> 00:31:20,160
Vegetarian.

459
00:31:21,920 --> 00:31:22,680
Egg and chives.

460
00:31:23,880 --> 00:31:27,160
And some... and some minced wood ear mushrooms.

461
00:31:27,160 --> 00:31:27,720
Don't make demands.

462
00:31:29,920 --> 00:31:30,480
Just a suggestion.

463
00:31:32,279 --> 00:31:32,839
Just a suggestion.

464
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:35,559
Fine. I'll eat whatever you make.

465
00:31:40,279 --> 00:31:41,319
One of the three deceased...

466
00:31:41,960 --> 00:31:43,920
Wu Sanlian, nicknamed Shuahai.

467
00:31:44,960 --> 00:31:45,920
As for the cause of death...

468
00:31:46,200 --> 00:31:48,920
Multiple stab wounds to the neck from a sharp object.

469
00:31:49,480 --> 00:31:50,920
He also had multiple bone fractures.

470
00:31:53,880 --> 00:31:55,039
This person is Liu Ming.

471
00:31:55,839 --> 00:31:57,039
He had a criminal record.

472
00:31:57,640 --> 00:31:59,680
His fingerprints were checked against the database.

473
00:32:00,240 --> 00:32:01,799
His time of death was earlier.

474
00:32:02,799 --> 00:32:04,519
Judging from the marks on his neck...

475
00:32:04,519 --> 00:32:07,079
The murder weapon was likely a wire of some sort.

476
00:32:08,119 --> 00:32:09,839
We also extracted some...

477
00:32:10,279 --> 00:32:11,440
...human skin tissue from his fingernails.

478
00:32:12,039 --> 00:32:13,000
It matched Shuahai's.

479
00:32:14,599 --> 00:32:15,680
Then why would someone killed by Shuahai...

480
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:17,759
...appear on Lu Haifeng's turf?

481
00:32:19,119 --> 00:32:22,119
This Liu Ming was Lu Haifeng's subordinate.

482
00:32:22,680 --> 00:32:25,480
His public identity was a security guard at the Elite Club.

483
00:32:25,839 --> 00:32:28,480
According to several of Lu Haifeng's other henchmen...

484
00:32:28,839 --> 00:32:30,720
...he was killed at the Elite Club.

485
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:33,640
At the time, to cover it up, Lu Haifeng...

486
00:32:34,640 --> 00:32:36,160
...had a few people secretly bury him.

487
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:41,160
Ding Yong, nicknamed Dayong.

488
00:32:41,559 --> 00:32:42,720
He was Lu Haifeng's right-hand man.

489
00:32:43,519 --> 00:32:44,359
And the cause of death?

490
00:32:44,920 --> 00:32:47,160
Blunt force trauma to the head.

491
00:32:47,680 --> 00:32:50,759
His head was covered with a black trash bag before he died.

492
00:32:51,640 --> 00:32:53,880
He also had multiple soft tissue contusions.

493
00:32:54,319 --> 00:32:56,160
There were also bind marks on his wrists.

494
00:32:56,400 --> 00:32:57,599
Judging from these marks...

495
00:32:58,079 --> 00:33:00,880
...he must have been abused and tortured before dying.

496
00:33:03,039 --> 00:33:05,240
Three bodies were found in this single pit.

497
00:33:05,720 --> 00:33:07,359
And their times of death were all different.

498
00:33:08,960 --> 00:33:11,920
The only thing we know right now is that Liu Ming...

499
00:33:12,720 --> 00:33:15,720
...died because Shuahai killed him.

500
00:33:16,440 --> 00:33:17,519
What about the other two?

501
00:33:18,480 --> 00:33:19,160
How did they die?

502
00:33:19,960 --> 00:33:20,839
We have no idea at all.

503
00:33:22,519 --> 00:33:22,960
Chief Guo.

504
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:25,519
There is still one that got away.

505
00:33:27,240 --> 00:33:27,599
It's him.

506
00:33:28,680 --> 00:33:29,519
His name is Liang Dayin.

507
00:33:29,839 --> 00:33:31,559
He's Ding Yong's right-hand man.

508
00:33:31,559 --> 00:33:33,359
He's also in Lu Haifeng's drug ring...

509
00:33:33,359 --> 00:33:33,960
...serving as a core member.

510
00:33:34,160 --> 00:33:35,279
This person is currently on the run.

511
00:33:35,759 --> 00:33:37,519
The Provincial Department has issued an Assistance Notice.

512
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:40,039
What's the situation over at Narcotics?

513
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:42,880
As for this operation...

514
00:33:42,880 --> 00:33:45,160
...a total of 27 suspects were apprehended.

515
00:33:45,599 --> 00:33:47,680
They all participated, more or less, in...

516
00:33:47,680 --> 00:33:50,200
...Lu Haifeng's drug trafficking and violent crimes.

517
00:33:50,799 --> 00:33:52,599
But none of them were involved in manufacturing drugs.

518
00:33:55,119 --> 00:33:56,039
Then what about the drug manufacturing?

519
00:33:56,359 --> 00:33:58,839
Are there any specific details?

520
00:33:59,279 --> 00:34:01,680
Lu Haifeng handled the drug manufacturing personally.

521
00:34:02,200 --> 00:34:03,079
He didn't let anyone else get involved.

522
00:34:07,279 --> 00:34:07,880
What about your side?

523
00:34:09,360 --> 00:34:10,519
We've checked the ledger.

524
00:34:11,320 --> 00:34:15,639
It matches the cash flow in the offshore accounts.

525
00:34:16,239 --> 00:34:18,519
Furthermore, we also found in the accounts...

526
00:34:19,079 --> 00:34:20,360
...Lang Tao's transaction records.

527
00:34:22,519 --> 00:34:24,639
Lao Na, any breakthrough with Yuan Lai now?

528
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:26,960
Well...

529
00:34:27,360 --> 00:34:28,519
As for Yuan Lai right now...

530
00:34:28,679 --> 00:34:30,400
...there is indeed no evidence proving she...

531
00:34:30,679 --> 00:34:32,280
...was directly involved in manufacturing or trafficking.

532
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:34,320
We've only managed to confirm...

533
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:36,280
...that Yuan Lai was Lu Haifeng's Mistress.

534
00:34:38,599 --> 00:34:39,599
Looking at it this way...

535
00:34:40,480 --> 00:34:44,119
...Er Hai using Yuan Lai to threaten Lu Haifeng...

536
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:46,519
...seems logical.

537
00:34:50,239 --> 00:34:51,079
I don't think it makes sense.

538
00:34:52,639 --> 00:34:53,079
Go on.

539
00:34:53,079 --> 00:34:54,920
Because that time at the pier...

540
00:34:54,960 --> 00:34:56,480
...Shuahai had Yuan Lai in his hands...

541
00:34:56,679 --> 00:34:58,199
...but he didn't use her to threaten Lu Haifeng.

542
00:34:58,199 --> 00:34:59,960
Instead, he planned to just take a boat and leave Red Leaf.

543
00:35:01,159 --> 00:35:01,639
Why is that?

544
00:35:06,679 --> 00:35:07,599
Doubts, doubts.

545
00:35:08,840 --> 00:35:09,960
If we have doubts, we investigate.

546
00:35:10,840 --> 00:35:12,960
With solid evidence, we make arrests.

547
00:35:16,719 --> 00:35:18,039
She was transferred to the Rehabilitation Center.

548
00:35:18,760 --> 00:35:19,159
Right.

549
00:35:20,280 --> 00:35:21,920
Currently, there's no evidence proving

550
00:35:21,920 --> 00:35:24,039
she was directly involved in making or selling drugs.

551
00:35:24,559 --> 00:35:26,480
We feel detention isn't necessary for now.

552
00:35:27,079 --> 00:35:27,840
Our top priority

553
00:35:27,840 --> 00:35:30,599
is for her to get clean first.

554
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:33,480
So that means it's nothing serious.

555
00:35:34,800 --> 00:35:36,039
The case isn't closed yet.

556
00:35:36,760 --> 00:35:37,800
As for any criminal liability,

557
00:35:37,800 --> 00:35:39,360
we have to wait for the final investigation results.

558
00:35:42,639 --> 00:35:43,760
How is the kid doing lately?

559
00:35:44,639 --> 00:35:47,800
Naonao is doing fine, just misses mom every day.

560
00:35:48,400 --> 00:35:51,239
Yeah, such a young kid definitely misses mom.

561
00:35:53,119 --> 00:35:53,559
Lao Zhang,

562
00:35:54,639 --> 00:35:56,039
visitation is allowed at the Rehabilitation Center, right?

563
00:35:58,559 --> 00:35:58,880
I don't know.

564
00:36:01,039 --> 00:36:01,639
Chief Liao,

565
00:36:02,159 --> 00:36:03,159
from what I recall,

566
00:36:03,159 --> 00:36:05,239
immediate family are definitely allowed to visit.

567
00:36:05,719 --> 00:36:08,119
But the kid is so young right now, how can...

568
00:36:13,519 --> 00:36:14,320
If I take him,

569
00:36:15,239 --> 00:36:16,480
it'll definitely be easier.

570
00:36:17,760 --> 00:36:18,679
Since Naonao

571
00:36:19,559 --> 00:36:20,639
is staying with you for now,

572
00:36:21,119 --> 00:36:22,239
if you take him,

573
00:36:22,360 --> 00:36:23,199
it definitely won't be a problem.

574
00:36:24,280 --> 00:36:26,000
How about I submit a request for you?

575
00:36:27,039 --> 00:36:27,840
Thanks, Captain Na.

576
00:36:29,280 --> 00:36:31,360
Come on, no need to be so formal.

577
00:36:31,920 --> 00:36:34,159
Let me know anytime you need anything.

578
00:36:34,599 --> 00:36:35,719
I'll let you know when it's done.

579
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:36,119
Alright.

580
00:36:36,239 --> 00:36:37,280
Alright, hanging up now.

581
00:36:37,480 --> 00:36:37,719
Bye.

582
00:36:41,760 --> 00:36:42,079
What?

583
00:36:44,079 --> 00:36:44,920
Honestly...

584
00:36:45,119 --> 00:36:45,920
You're unbelievable.

585
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:47,000
I mean, he's just a kid.

586
00:36:47,000 --> 00:36:47,480
What's wrong with him seeing his mom?

587
00:36:47,480 --> 00:36:48,239
I don't even want to talk to you.

588
00:37:09,559 --> 00:37:10,159
Naonao.

589
00:37:16,719 --> 00:37:18,079
I have some good news for you.

590
00:37:19,000 --> 00:37:19,960
What good news?

591
00:37:20,760 --> 00:37:21,599
What good news?

592
00:37:23,480 --> 00:37:24,800
You can go see your mom.

593
00:37:25,960 --> 00:37:26,519
Really?

594
00:37:27,920 --> 00:37:28,679
Uncle Liao!

595
00:37:29,679 --> 00:37:31,960
Let's go! Let's go see Mom! Let's go see Mom!

596
00:37:32,639 --> 00:37:35,000
It's too late now. The hospital is closed.

597
00:37:35,320 --> 00:37:36,440
Let's go tomorrow, okay?

598
00:37:38,960 --> 00:37:41,239
But you have to promise Uncle Liao one thing.

599
00:37:41,679 --> 00:37:42,320
What is it?

600
00:37:43,800 --> 00:37:45,320
Mom has an infectious disease,

601
00:37:46,519 --> 00:37:47,800
so she can't live at home.

602
00:37:50,199 --> 00:37:50,840
Remember?

603
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:52,119
I remember.

604
00:37:52,880 --> 00:37:55,079
So when you go see Mom tomorrow,

605
00:37:55,480 --> 00:37:57,719
you can't get too close.

606
00:37:58,599 --> 00:38:00,199
You'll have to see her through the glass.

607
00:38:01,440 --> 00:38:02,000
Got it?

608
00:38:02,599 --> 00:38:03,119
Got it.

609
00:38:03,920 --> 00:38:04,280
Go play.

610
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:11,280
Goose, I can go see Mom tomorrow!

611
00:38:21,360 --> 00:38:22,119
Uncle Liao

612
00:38:22,760 --> 00:38:24,519
When is Mommy coming?

613
00:38:24,639 --> 00:38:25,559
Mommy will be here soon.

614
00:38:26,840 --> 00:38:27,880
Try to find where Mommy is.

615
00:38:32,599 --> 00:38:33,480
Right there. Mommy, right there.

616
00:38:34,199 --> 00:38:39,039
Mommy! Mommy! Mommy!

617
00:38:39,039 --> 00:38:44,559
Mommy! Mommy! Mommy!

618
00:38:44,960 --> 00:38:50,159
Mommy! Mommy! Mommy!

619
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:59,039
I told Naonao...

620
00:38:59,280 --> 00:39:00,079
...that you're sick.

621
00:39:01,920 --> 00:39:03,039
Naonao, talk to Mommy.

622
00:39:06,440 --> 00:39:09,480
Mommy, are you feeling better?

623
00:39:12,519 --> 00:39:13,519
Mommy is feeling better.

624
00:39:15,079 --> 00:39:16,400
I just miss Naonao a little.

625
00:39:17,639 --> 00:39:20,159
Mommy, Naonao misses you too.

626
00:39:24,159 --> 00:39:25,440
But Naonao didn't cry.

627
00:39:26,400 --> 00:39:27,920
Ask Uncle Liao if you don't believe me.

628
00:39:31,320 --> 00:39:33,159
Naonao didn't cry. Naonao is a big boy.

629
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:35,599
Right? We don't cry.

630
00:39:37,800 --> 00:39:39,960
Mommy, does it hurt?

631
00:39:44,440 --> 00:39:45,400
It doesn't hurt.

632
00:39:47,039 --> 00:39:48,679
Uncle Liao told me...

633
00:39:49,039 --> 00:39:50,320
...that for Naonao's sake...

634
00:39:50,639 --> 00:39:52,239
...you have to be isolated here for treatment.

635
00:39:52,639 --> 00:39:54,159
And we have to be separated by glass.

636
00:39:54,880 --> 00:39:57,199
That's the only way to prevent droplet transmission.

637
00:39:57,920 --> 00:40:01,199
Mommy, you have to listen to the doctor.

638
00:40:01,639 --> 00:40:02,679
Get well soon.

639
00:40:06,800 --> 00:40:09,280
Naonao has grown up and is so sensible.

640
00:40:10,400 --> 00:40:12,920
You need to listen to Uncle Liao too, okay?

641
00:40:14,079 --> 00:40:17,039
Mommy, Naonao is not a little kid anymore.

642
00:40:17,840 --> 00:40:21,039
Uncle Liao just said Naonao is a big boy.

643
00:40:25,400 --> 00:40:26,960
Naonao is a big boy.

644
00:40:28,719 --> 00:40:32,320
When you get better, Naonao will take you to the amusement park.

645
00:40:33,400 --> 00:40:36,519
No, no. Mommy likes Snow White.

646
00:40:36,519 --> 00:40:39,239
Then Naonao will take you to Snow White's castle.

647
00:40:41,320 --> 00:40:43,599
Okay. Naonao is so sensible.

648
00:40:44,760 --> 00:40:47,159
We can also go to that...

649
00:40:47,159 --> 00:40:49,000
...pizza place Uncle Liao mentioned.

650
00:40:49,400 --> 00:40:51,400
The three of us can go eat pizza together, okay?

651
00:40:52,679 --> 00:40:54,960
Okay, then I'll pay the bill.

652
00:40:55,599 --> 00:40:56,480
Mommy!

653
00:40:57,119 --> 00:40:58,840
I've saved up...

654
00:40:58,840 --> 00:41:00,719
...308.20 yuan.

655
00:41:02,480 --> 00:41:04,280
You're so amazing!

656
00:41:05,639 --> 00:41:06,320
Naonao.

657
00:41:08,880 --> 00:41:11,400
Um, Naonao, you must remember to take your medicine.

658
00:41:11,400 --> 00:41:12,440
Take it on time.

659
00:41:13,000 --> 00:41:16,760
Three times a day, one pill after each meal.

660
00:41:17,679 --> 00:41:18,440
Got it?

661
00:41:18,639 --> 00:41:21,960
And drink milk, drink plenty of water.

662
00:41:22,400 --> 00:41:24,960
And stop eating candy, or your teeth will rot.

663
00:41:28,239 --> 00:41:29,440
Don't worry, don't worry.

664
00:41:32,039 --> 00:41:32,679
Pinky promise.

665
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:42,840
Pinky promise.

666
00:41:42,840 --> 00:41:43,559
Seal it.

667
00:41:43,559 --> 00:41:45,239
No changing for a hundred years.

668
00:42:08,719 --> 00:42:09,320
Time's up.

669
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:15,920
Listen,

670
00:42:16,360 --> 00:42:17,440
Naonao, remember this.

671
00:42:17,599 --> 00:42:19,239
Listen to the phone. Listen to the phone.

672
00:42:21,000 --> 00:42:21,960
Naonao, remember this.

673
00:42:22,320 --> 00:42:23,320
This place...

674
00:42:24,840 --> 00:42:26,880
...is full of infectious germs.

675
00:42:27,239 --> 00:42:29,679
Once Mom is better, she'll come find you.

676
00:42:30,039 --> 00:42:32,119
Don't come here anymore. Got it?

677
00:42:33,360 --> 00:42:34,239
Thank you so much.

678
00:42:34,559 --> 00:42:35,159
Time's up.

679
00:42:35,519 --> 00:42:37,679
Okay, okay. I know. I know.

680
00:42:37,960 --> 00:42:40,039
Don't worry. Naonao is safe with me.

681
00:42:40,039 --> 00:42:41,719
Thank you so much. Thank you.

682
00:42:42,800 --> 00:42:44,480
Naonao, Mom loves you.

683
00:42:45,000 --> 00:42:47,679
Mom, I love you too.

684
00:42:52,320 --> 00:42:53,719
I love you too.

685
00:42:55,840 --> 00:42:56,920
I love you, Naonao.

686
00:43:12,480 --> 00:43:14,039
Regarding Yuan Lai's bank card,

687
00:43:14,239 --> 00:43:15,480
are the investigation results out?

688
00:43:15,639 --> 00:43:17,280
There's a total of 1.51 million on the card.

689
00:43:17,719 --> 00:43:19,559
So, is there a problem or not?

690
00:43:21,440 --> 00:43:24,239
Welcome back victorious, Commissar Tan.

691
00:43:24,480 --> 00:43:25,360
Tell us,

692
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:27,239
what was the last image in your mind?

693
00:43:27,840 --> 00:43:28,079
I...

694
00:43:28,920 --> 00:43:29,400
A-Yuan...

695
00:43:30,360 --> 00:43:30,760
Help me.

696
00:43:32,079 --> 00:43:33,400
After Lu Haifeng took you hostage

697
00:43:33,559 --> 00:43:34,559
and ran into me,

698
00:43:35,159 --> 00:43:35,880
what happened?
